{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the game</strong><br>Parking in Tight Spaces is a fun, tricky game where you park trucks, buses, and other vehicles in tight spots, It\u2019s all about smooth moves and sharp turns. Vehicles can attach a trailers or even other vehicles. Brought to life by two indie devs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay\u00a0</strong><br>The game has a level structure. Each level is a riddle. Solve it and you will unlock the next one. Each new level is more difficult than the previous one. If you pass it without collisions and in the allotted time you will get more points. Compete with other players in the leaderboard.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2127390?t=1750145522","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127390/9e09e59cfca314d8168bbe4e21d488ed4f8c6213/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750145522","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127390/8403f33298a0f3283e1aa6debf001551db8a1413/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750145522","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127390/8403f33298a0f3283e1aa6debf001551db8a1413/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750145522","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the game</strong><br>Parking in Tight Spaces is a fun, tricky game where you park trucks, buses, and other vehicles in tight spots, It\u2019s all about smooth moves and sharp turns. Vehicles can attach a trailers o